        <div style="font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:900;color:var(--cream);margin-bottom:4px;">Every business is different. These are starting points.</div>
        <div style="font-size:0.8rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;">Bundle services, adjust scope, add locations — we'll build a transparent, right-sized quote for your specific situation. No hidden fees. No markups on hardware.</div>
      </div>
      <button onclick="openQuoteModal()" style="font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:800;background:var(--flame);color:var(--white);border:none;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;transition:background 0.2s;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(232,106,26,0.3);flex-shrink:0;"
